# GoReleaser output. MUST stay ignored: Go's build stamper counts UNTRACKED
# files as tree modifications, so an unignored dist/ makes every goreleaser
# build stamp vcs.modified=true (+dirty) BY CONSTRUCTION — v0.2.0's and
# v0.2.1's published assets both shipped +dirty from exactly this.
/dist/

